{{PageBanner|Clb l 003 4 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular anime '''Neon Genesis Evangelion''' (新世紀エヴァンゲリオン, ''Shinseiki Evangerion'', '''Neon Genesis Evangelion''') was originally held from March 16th, 2018 to March 30th, 2018. The collaboration includes [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive]] [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event/2nd Gacha Drop|Gachas]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration the period.<br>
The anime is published by Kadokawa Shoten.

==Event Information==
All soldiers, battle stations!<br>
Celebrate the EVANGELION:30+；event with the return of the {{Color|#9900FF|'''EVANGELION'''}} collab to The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from February 21st (11:00am) until February 25th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> To access collab content, you must clear Empire of Cats Chapter 1 stage "Japan".

{{Color|#E97132|'''● Limited EVANGELION Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Draw from the {{Color|#FF0000|'''EVANGELION Capsules'''}} and {{Color|#9900FF|'''EVANGELION Collab Capsules 2nd Strike'''}} in the Rare Capsules for a limited time!<br>
Tap the banner to check the lineup of exclusive units and their abilities!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Characters indicated above will be available only during this event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Units indicated above will be available only from the collab banners at the Rare Capsules. Tap the banner at the top of the screen to switch between Capsules sets.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Collab Stages!'''}}<br>
EVANGELION characters appear as foes in a variety of challenging stages! Ready units with the {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''EVA Angel Killer'''}} effect and {{Color|#FF0000|'''boost the ability's effectiveness'''}} before diving in!

{{Color|#4EA72E|'''Plus, all stage rewards have been reset'''}}!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this collab event to challenge EVANGELION collab stages!

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Stage "EVANGELION Activates!"'''}}<br>
Clear this stage for a chance to earn limited Rare unit {{Color|#0000FF|'''Shinji & Cat'''}}!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect this unit as a drop reward.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> You cannot collect this reward again if already earned from a previous event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Activate this unit by visiting the Upgrade menu.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Stage: "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Challenge the 6th Angel and earn TONS of XP!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, XP, etc.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Stage: "The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}}<br>
Face an onslaught of Angels for a chance to earn the Rare unit {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect this unit as a drop reward.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> You cannot collect this reward again if already earned from a previous event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Activate this unit by visiting the Upgrade menu.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Stage "The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}}<br>
Destroy the ultimate Refusal Type Angel!<br>
Unlock Kaworu & Cat's True Form evolution, or other amazing rewards!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Units must be at Level 20 or higher to evolve into their True Form.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This unit's True Form can still be unlocked before the unit itself is acquired.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Stage: "EVA Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}}<br>
A weapon that should not exist! Face down the terrifying EVA Unit-13!<br>
Unlock Shinji & Cat's True Form evolution, or other amazing rewards!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Units must be at Level 20 or higher to evolve into their True Form.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This unit's True Form can still be unlocked before the unit itself is acquired.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

For more information on EVANGELION, visit:<br>
https://www.evangelion.jp/<br>
